<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Simple. Powerful. Reliable.</div><h1>Run your school with <em>clarity.</em></h1><p class="lead">EduCore brings admissions, academics, attendance, finance, staff management, results and communication together — so your school runs smoothly from one secure platform.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="{{ route('school.register') }}">Start Free</a><a class="btn btn-white" href="{{ Route::has('admin.login') ? route('admin.login') : '#' }}">Login</a></div><div class="proof"><span>Secure access</span><span>Built for Nigerian schools</span><span>Web + Android</span><span>Easy to use</span></div></div>
<div class="device-stage"><div class="halo"></div><div class="trust-badge">Trusted school-management architecture</div><div class="laptop"><div class="browser"><div class="browserbar"><i class="dot"></i><i class="dot"></i><i class="dot"></i></div><div class="dash"><aside class="side"><div class="side-logo"><img src="/brand/educore-icon.svg" alt="">EduCore</div><a>Dashboard</a><a>Students</a><a>Attendance</a><a>Academics</a><a>Finance</a><a>Reports</a></aside><div class="main"><div class="mainhead"><b>School Overview</b><span>2026/2027 · First Term</span></div><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><small>Students</small><strong>1,250</strong></div><div class="metric"><small>Staff</small><strong>87</strong></div><div class="metric"><small>Attendance</small><strong>92%</strong></div><div class="metric"><small>Fees</small><strong>₦12.6M</strong></div></div><div class="panels"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-title">Fee collection trend</div><div class="chart"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-title">Attendance today</div><div class="donut"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="phone"><div class="phone-top"><img src="/brand/educore-icon.svg" alt=""><small>Good morning</small><b>EduCore Mobile</b></div><div class="phone-body"><div class="phone-card"><b>Attendance</b><span>Daily school activity</span></div><div class="phone-card"><b>Finance</b><span>Billing and collections</span></div><div class="phone-card"><b>Academics</b><span>Scores and results</span></div><div class="phone-card"><b>Notifications</b><span>School communication</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<div class="rolebar"><div class="container rolebar-row"><strong>One platform. Every role. A stronger school.</strong><span>School Admin</span><span>Teachers</span><span>Students</span><span>Parents</span><span>Accountants</span><span>Officers</span></div></div>
<section class="section" id="features"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div class="kicker">All school operations</div><h2>One platform for the work that keeps your school moving.</h2><p>EduCore connects core school workflows so records remain organised, authorised users stay focused, and management has a clearer view of operations.</p></div><div class="feature-grid">
<article class="feature"><div class="feature-icon">A</div><h3>Admissions & Records</h3><p>Manage applications, enrolment, student records, classes, transfers, progression and graduation.</p></article>
<article class="feature"><div class="feature-icon">⌂</div><h3>Academics & Exams</h3><p>Teacher assignments, lessons, score entry, examinations, results, report cards and broadsheets.</p></article>
<article class="feature"><div class="feature-icon">✓</div><h3>Attendance & Timetable</h3><p>Student and staff attendance, schedules, work hours, timetables and attendance reporting.</p></article>
<article class="feature"><div class="feature-icon">₦</div><h3>Fees, Billing & Payroll</h3><p>School billing, payment records, balances, expenses and staff payroll in a connected finance workspace.</p></article>
<article class="feature"><div class="feature-icon">P</div><h3>Parents & Communication</h3><p>Give parents controlled access to linked children while keeping school notices and communication organised.</p></article>
<article class="feature"><div class="feature-icon">↗</div><h3>Reports & Analytics</h3><p>Bring academic, attendance, financial and operational information together for clearer school oversight.</p></article>
<article class="feature wide"><div class="feature-icon">S</div><h3>Staff & School Operations</h3><p>Coordinate staff records, role permissions, health, transport and other operational responsibilities from dedicated workspaces.</p></article>
